# Device usernames must exactly match their sensor id. This pattern prevents a
# credentialed device from publishing to another device's topic. The reserved
# bridge account is denied all writes, including its own username-shaped topic.
pattern write city/sensors/%u/data
pattern deny city/sensors/iot-bridge/data

# The bridge is a service account with read-only access to telemetry topics.
user iot-bridge
topic read city/sensors/+/data
